# ------------------------------------------------------------
# FlowDesk AI Dashboard Environment Variables
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Database provider:
# Supabase PostgreSQL
#
# ORM:
# Prisma
#
# Architecture:
# Next.js Server -> Prisma Client -> Supabase PostgreSQL
#
# Do not expose these values to the browser.
# Do not prefix these variables with NEXT_PUBLIC_.

# Runtime database connection used by Prisma Client.
# For serverless deployments such as Vercel, prefer Supabase Supavisor
# transaction pooler connection, usually using port 6543.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:6543/postgres"

# Direct/session database connection used by Prisma Migrate.
# Prefer Supabase direct connection or Supavisor session pooler,
# usually using port 5432.
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/postgres"

# Notes:
# - Replace USER, PASSWORD, HOST, and PORT with values from Supabase.
# - Real values belong in .env.
# - .env must never be committed.
# - .env.example can be committed.
# - Do not add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL or NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY yet.
# - Supabase Auth, Realtime, Storage, and RLS policies are not used in this MVP phase.
